--- the slot rule's one owner ---
a fold whose product overflows is refused, not wrapped: true
the same shape at a representable extent folds its two outer slots onto .z: true
per-slot maxima are taken across nests before the fold: true
--- ranks 1 to 5, dependent nests over equal traversals ---
pp_rank1_tail: launch grid 4;1;1 block 256;1;1: true
pp_rank1_tail: every producer cell: true
pp_rank1_tail: every consumer cell: true
pp_rank2: launch grid 96;1;1 block 40;1;1: true
pp_rank2: every producer cell: true
pp_rank2: every consumer cell: true
pp_rank3_small_leading: launch grid 20;6;1 block 48;1;1: true
pp_rank3_small_leading: every producer cell: true
pp_rank3_small_leading: every consumer cell: true
pp_rank4: launch grid 5;4;3 block 64;1;1: true
pp_rank4: every producer cell: true
pp_rank4: every consumer cell: true
pp_rank5_fold: launch grid 5;4;6 block 32;1;1: true
pp_rank5_fold: every producer cell: true
pp_rank5_fold: every consumer cell: true
pp_singleton: launch grid 50;1;4 block 32;1;1: true
pp_singleton: every producer cell: true
pp_singleton: every consumer cell: true
pp_lane_split_tail: launch grid 2;6;1 block 256;1;1: true
pp_lane_split_tail: every producer cell: true
pp_lane_split_tail: every consumer cell: true
--- device caps: the lane plan at the cap, the two-loop plan past it ---
pp_grid_y_at_cap: launch grid 5;4;3 block 64;1;1: true
pp_grid_y_at_cap: every producer cell: true
pp_grid_y_at_cap: every consumer cell: true
pp_grid_y_past_cap: launch grid 5;1;1 block 64;1;1: true
pp_grid_y_past_cap: every producer cell: true
pp_grid_y_past_cap: every consumer cell: true
pp_grid_z_at_cap: launch grid 5;4;6 block 32;1;1: true
pp_grid_z_at_cap: every producer cell: true
pp_grid_z_at_cap: every consumer cell: true
pp_grid_z_past_cap: launch grid 5;1;1 block 32;1;1: true
pp_grid_z_past_cap: every producer cell: true
pp_grid_z_past_cap: every consumer cell: true
--- workgroup fill ---
pp_fill_2d: launch grid 16;2;1 block 32;8;1: true
pp_fill_2d: every producer cell: true
pp_fill_2d: every consumer cell: true
pp_fill_1d: launch grid 8;16;2 block 32;1;1: true
pp_fill_1d: every producer cell: true
pp_fill_1d: every consumer cell: true
pp_fill_y_past_cap: launch grid 8;16;2 block 32;1;1: true
pp_fill_y_past_cap: every producer cell: true
pp_fill_y_past_cap: every consumer cell: true
pp_fill_y_at_cap: launch grid 16;2;1 block 32;8;1: true
pp_fill_y_at_cap: every producer cell: true
pp_fill_y_at_cap: every consumer cell: true
--- dependent nests over unequal traversals ---
pp_transposed: launch grid 4;1;1 block 32;1;1: true
pp_transposed: every transposed consumer cell: true
--- mixed ranks in one kernel ---
pp_mixed_split: launch grid 8;16;1 block 64;1;1: true
pp_mixed_split: every cell of the first node: true
pp_mixed_split: every cell of the second node: true
pp_mixed_fallback: launch grid 16;1;1 block 64;1;1: true
pp_mixed_fallback: every cell of the first node: true
pp_mixed_fallback: every cell of the second node: true
pp_zeros_mixed_split: launch grid 8;16;1 block 64;1;1: true
pp_zeros_mixed_split: every cell of every node is cleared: true
pp_zeros_singleton: launch grid 20;6;1 block 48;1;1: true
pp_zeros_singleton: every cell of every node is cleared: true
pp_zeros_mixed_fallback: launch grid 16;1;1 block 64;1;1: true
pp_zeros_mixed_fallback: every cell of every node is cleared: true
